9},[412,603,443],{"class":422},[412,605,606],{"class":439},"Backup email",[412,608,443],{"class":422},[412,610,506],{"class":429},[412,612,509],{"class":422},[412,614,616,619,621,624,626,628,631,633],{"class":414,"line":615},8,[412,617,618],{"class":487},"  approvedAmount",[412,620,491],{"class":422},[412,622,623],{"class":474}," optionalNonNegativeNumber",[412,625,478],{"class":429},[412,627,443],{"class":422},[412,629,630],{"class":439},"Approved amount",[412,632,443],{"class":422},[412,634,635],{"class":429},")\n",[412,637,639,642,644],{"class":414,"line":638},9,[412,640,641],{"class":422},"}",[412,643,506],{"class":429},[412,645,446],{"class":422},[288,647,648,649,651],{},"Add reusable format, length or range rules to the shared file; cross-field rules specific to one page stay in that form. Compose them with Valibot ",[292,650,548],{}," instead of building a separate validation config language.",[288,653,654,655,658,659,662,663,666,667,670,671,674,675,679],{},"File fields (",[292,656,657],{},"ShuoFile",") bind ",[292,660,661],{},"File | null",". Combine Valibot's ",[292,664,665],{},"v.file",", ",[292,668,669],{},"v.mimeType"," and ",[292,672,673],{},"v.maxSize"," for required, type and size checks; see ",[317,676,678],{"href":677},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Fphone-file\u002Ffile#with-form-validation","With form validation"," on the File page.",[681,682,683,684,401],"note",{},"Dates and options are currently only checked for being required. Add rules for date formats, whether an option is still valid, cross-field conditions, numeric ranges and so on as needed, for example ",[292,685,686],{},"v.pipe(v.number(), v.minValue(1), v.maxValue(100))",[309,688,690],{"id":689},"empty-values-and-types","Empty values and types",[288,692,693,694,697,698,701,702,705,706,708,709,712,713,717,718,721,722,670,725,728,729,731],{},"Components write ",[292,695,696],{},"null"," \u002F ",[292,699,700],{},"undefined"," bound by the parent back as the agreed empty value (",[292,703,704],{},"''"," for text, ",[292,707,696],{}," for numbers, ",[292,710,711],{},"[]"," for date ranges and so on; see ",[317,714,716],{"href":715},"\u002Fcomponents\u002Foverview\u002Fcommon#empty-values","Empty values","). Unexpected values are cleared, and most components also log a ",[292,719,720],{},"console.warn"," (",[292,723,724],{},"ShuoSelectMenu",[292,726,727],{},"ShuoMonths"," only clear without warning; see the same section). An unselected radio group is ",[292,730,704],{},", so options should not use an empty string as their value.",[288,733,734,735,697,737,739,740,666,743,746],{},"The input types of the shared schemas accept ",[292,736,696],{},[292,738,700],{}," while editing, and the output after validation narrows to ",[292,741,742],{},"string",[292,744,745],{},"number"," or an array of the item type, so you do not need to change the components' empty-value contract.",[309,748,750],{"id":749},"display-and-interaction","Display and interaction",[752,753,754,762,780],"ul",{},[755,756,757,758,761],"li",{},"We recommend the built-in theme (",[292,759,760],{},"theme: true",") for error messages: a floating style inset in the field's bottom border that does not add to the field height. Keep enough spacing between fields, and avoid clipping overflowing content in the containers.",[755,763,764,767,768,771,772,775,776,779],{},[292,765,766],{},"UForm"," only fires ",[292,769,770],{},"@submit"," after validation passes; read the validated data from ",[292,773,774],{},"event.data",". When validation fails, ",[292,777,778],{},"@error"," fires.",[755,781,782,783,786],{},"Use the default validation timing on input, blur and change. When resetting, besides clearing the state, call the form's ",[292,784,785],{},"clear()"," to clear the errors.",[788,789,790],"style",{},"html pre.shiki code .s7zQu, html code.shiki .s7zQu{--shiki-light:#39ADB5;--shiki-light-font-style:italic;--shiki-default:#89DDFF;--shiki-default-font-style:italic;--shiki-dark:#89DDFF;--shiki-dark-font-style:ita